---

<section id="profile" class="profile-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card profile-card">
      <div class="profile-content">
        <div class="profile-info">
          <h1 class="text-center">백엔드 개발자 김백엔드</h1>
          <p class="subtitle text-center">5년차 백엔드 개발자</p>
          <div class="intro">
            <p>안녕하세요. 5년간 백엔드 개발을 해온 개발자입니다.</p>
            <p>주로 Java/Spring, Python, Node.js 를 활용한 서버 개발과 AWS 클라우드 인프라 구축 경험이 있습니다.</p>
            <p>대용량 트래픽 처리와 마이크로서비스 아키텍처 설계에 관심이 많습니다.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="skills">
            <h3>주요 기술 스택</h3>
            <div class="skill-tags">
              <span class="tag">Java</span>
              <span class="tag">Spring Boot</span>
              <span class="tag">Python</span>
              <span class="tag">Django</span>
              <span class="tag">Node.js</span>
              <span class="tag">AWS</span>
              <span class="tag">Docker</span>
              <span class="tag">Kubernetes</span>
              <span class="tag">MySQL</span>
              <span class="tag">PostgreSQL</span>
              <span class="tag">Redis</span>
              <span class="tag">Kafka</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="contact-info">
            <div class="contact-item">
              <strong>이메일:</strong> backend.dev@example.com
            </div>
            <div class="contact-item">
              <strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/backend-dev" target="_blank">github.com/backend-dev</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .profile-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
  }

  .profile-card {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: #64748b;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .intro {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.03);
    border-radius: 16px;
    border-left: 4px solid rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.3);
  }

  .intro p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: #475569;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .skills {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .skill-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .skills .tag {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.1) 0%, rgba(118, 75, 162, 0.1) 100%);
    color: #5a67d8;
    border: 1px solid rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.2);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .skills .tag:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.2) 0%, rgba(118, 75, 162, 0.2) 100%);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.2);
  }

  .contact-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-top: 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(225, 229, 235, 0.8);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .contact-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.8);
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(225, 229, 235, 0.5);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .contact-item:hover {
    background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.05);
    border-color: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.2);
  }

  .contact-item strong {
    color: #4a5568;
    font-weight: 600;
    min-width: 60px;
  }

  .contact-item a {
    color: #667eea;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .contact-item a:hover {
    color: #5a67d8;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .profile-section {
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    .intro p {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .contact-info {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .contact-item {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 4px;
    }
  }
</style>